{"ris": [{"id": "riS", "headword": "रिश्", "headword_slp1": "riS", "fold": "ris", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "रिश् (cf. √ रिष्, from which it is not in all forms distinguishable) cl. 6. P. (Dhātup. xxviii, 126) रिश॑ति (Ved. also ˚ते; pf. रिरेश &c. Gr.),\nto hurt, tear, pluck off, crop, RV. :\nCaus. रेशयति (aor. अरीरिशत्) Gr.:\nDesid. रिरिक्षति, ib. (cf. √ रिष्) :\nIntens. रेरिश्यते, रेरेष्टि, ib.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}, {"id": "riz", "headword": "रिष्", "headword_slp1": "riz", "fold": "ris", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "1. रिष् (cf. √ रिश्) cl. 1. 4. P. (Dhātup. xvii, 43 and xxvi, 120 v.l.) रेषति or रि॑ष्यति (ep. also रिष्यते; aor. रीढ्वम्, TĀr. अरिषत् Subj. रिषाथ, p. रीषत् or रिषत्, RV.; अरेषीत् Gr.; fut. रेषिता, रेष्टा, ib., रेषिष्यति, ib.; inf. रेषितुम्, or रेष्टुम्, ib.; Ved. inf. रिषे॑, रिष॑स्),\nto be hurt or injured, receive harm, suffer wrong, perish, be lost, fail, RV. &c. &c.;\nto injure, hurt, harm, destroy, ruin, RV.; AV.; Bhaṭṭ.;\n Caus. रेष॑यति (aor. अरीरिषत्; Ved. forms रीरिषीष्ट or रिरिषीष्ट, रिरिषेः, रिषय॑ध्यै),\nto hurt, injure, harm, cause to miscarry or fail, RV.; AV.; TBr.; MBh.;\n (Ā. रीरिषीष्ट), to fail, meet with misfortune or disaster, BhP. :\nDesid. रि॑रिक्षति (RV.; रिरिषिषति or रिरेषिषति Gr.),\nto wish to injure or harm (cf. √ रिश्) :\nIntens. रेरिष्यते, रेरेष्टि Gr.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "2. रि॑ष् f. injury or an injurer, RV. (for, -रिषे॑, रिष॑स् See under √ 1. रिष्).", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "risa": [{"id": "riSa", "headword": "रिश", "headword_slp1": "riSa", "fold": "risa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "रिश॑ mfn. tearing", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "रिश॑ m. an injurer, enemy (cf. रिशादस्)", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["रिशः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["riSaH"]}, {"id": "riSA", "headword": "रिशा", "headword_slp1": "riSA", "fold": "risa", "headword_language": "sa", "source